{"id":"714263767","kind":"article","title":"比较教学场景","author":"Issa Rice","original_authors":["Issa Rice"],"original_source_urls":["https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Comparison_of_pedagogical_scenes"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"Issawiki & Learning","date":"2024-08-13","updated":"2024-08-13","votes":15,"comment_count":2,"minutes":2,"chars":991,"keywords":["教学设计","学习媒介","可探索解释","间隔重复","思想工具","解释学"],"summary":"这份表格比较数学教材、思想工具、研究综述、可探索解释、视频、可汗学院、间隔重复及解释学等教学媒介，按知识覆盖、难题深度、解释或实践取向、研究解释本身等维度梳理其特点。作者借比较凸显新型媒介在实践创造与元层次解释上的不同定位。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/714263767","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":3,"title":"另见"},{"id":"sec-2","level":3,"title":"链接到本文"},{"id":"sec-3","level":3,"title":"参考文献"},{"id":"sec-4","level":3,"title":"附注"}],"html":"<p></p><table data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"table\" data-row-style=\"normal\" data-size=\"normal\"><tbody><tr><th>名称</th><th>媒介</th><th>力求全面覆盖所有知识点吗？[1]</th><th>讨论深入/困难的主题，迫使学习者思考吗？[2]</th><th>重点是解释还是创造/实践？</th><th>重点是分析解释吗？[3]</th><th>全新概念，还是「旧瓶装新酒，但是更快更锃亮」？</th></tr><tr><td>主流数学教材，比如陶哲轩, Axler, Spivak 的优质数学教材</td><td>文本</td><td>是</td><td>是（但这是一项非常艰巨的工作！）</td><td>解释</td><td>不是</td><td>老一套</td></tr><tr><td>思想工具</td><td>目标是创建新媒介！</td><td>是？</td><td>是？</td><td>创造/实践</td><td>是</td><td>全新的概念！</td></tr><tr><td>研究成果精炼[1]</td><td>以文本为主，有一些可交互小组件</td><td>否</td><td>有一点（有启发性，但大部分网上文章不那么深入）</td><td>解释</td><td>不，至少不是在公共场合</td><td>更快更好</td></tr><tr><td>可探索的解释</td><td>可交互小组件</td><td>否</td><td>不完全是</td><td>解释</td><td>否</td><td>新旧兼有</td></tr><tr><td>3Blue1Brown</td><td>不可交互的可视化视频</td><td>否</td><td>否</td><td>解释</td><td>否</td><td>新旧兼有</td></tr><tr><td>可汗学院</td><td>像教学一样的视频和文本</td><td>解释</td><td>是，但只关注「简单领域」</td><td>有一点，但只关注「简单」领域</td><td>否</td><td>只关注「高中话题」</td></tr><tr><td>间隔重复和「学习如何学习」</td><td>闪卡，笔记</td><td>是</td><td>是（但主要是你在做工作）</td><td>创造/实践</td><td>是</td><td>是，有关于写好卡片的讨论以及新的学习技术</td></tr><tr><td>异步交流的 Discord 服务器</td><td>在线聊天室</td><td>并非独立学习资源，但优质服务器能覆盖教材全部章节，为学习者提供跨阶段帮助</td><td>是（提问者往往直面学习难点疑惑）</td><td>解释</td><td>否</td><td>概念本身很新，但建成后往往缺乏持续优化动力，而着眼拓展覆盖更多教材和数学分支</td></tr><tr><td>解释学</td><td>主要是文本？</td><td>是（愿景）</td><td>是</td><td>解释</td><td>是</td><td>全新的概念！</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id=\"sec-1\">另见</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"iVcurqXq\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Scenius\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">群体创造力</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-2\">链接到本文</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"00ac_qRC\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Explanation_science\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">解释学</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup> (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Explanation+science\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">← 链接</a>)</li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-3\">参考文献</h3><ol><li data-pid=\"lhp61tEA\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/#cite_ref-4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">↑</a> <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.comhttps//distill.pub/2017/research-debt/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://distill.pub/2017/research-debt/</a></li></ol><h3 id=\"sec-4\">附注</h3><ol><li data-pid=\"YGBkSrYo\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/#cite_ref-1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">↑</a> 这些材料是否内容全面，可以作为一套独立完整的学习资源？还是更多地起到辅助作用，为学习主题增添趣味性？<br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"W0CcOT07\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/#cite_ref-2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">↑</a> 练习设计是否考虑到<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.comhttps//learning.subwiki.org/wiki/Importance_of_struggling_in_learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">合意困难</a>，能够真正帮助学习者深入理解和牢固掌握所学知识？<br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"tVddtevk\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/#cite_ref-3\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">↑</a> 在该领域或场景中，对解释方法本身的探讨是否被视为研究工作的核心内容？还是更多地发生在幕后，不为大众所关注？提出一种解释事物的新技术是否被认为是对该领域的重要贡献？该领域是否鼓励和接纳运用「元分析」的思路和方法来审视问题？<br/> </li></ol><blockquote data-pid=\"ADhGlV_T\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 Shom、校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Comparison_of_pedagogical_scenes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Comparison of pedagogical scenes</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 解释学 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"574139400\" href=\"#/post/574139400\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"713659217","title":"数学探索需要将问题情境加载到工作记忆","author":"Issa Rice","votes":20,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"714466433","title":"全面详尽的测验可以让急于求成的学习者跳过文本阅读","author":"Issa Rice","votes":23,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"574139400","title":"解释学","author":"Issa Rice","votes":16,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"578514534","title":"3Blue1Brown","author":"Issa Rice","votes":1044,"minutes":3,"reason":"延伸引用本文"},{"id":"598332415","title":"可探索的解释","author":"Issa Rice","votes":6,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸引用本文"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"1944442771533432041","title":"纠错练习","author":"Vipul","votes":8,"minutes":3,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Vipul"},{"id":"404586617","title":"专家回答启发式（来自 Issa Rice）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":12,"minutes":1,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「间隔重复」· Andy Matuschak"}],"rec_answers":[]}